  "graderHint": "validateLpa",
  "note": "validateLpa() (also exported as calculateGrade) folds statutory blocker rules, non-blocking flags, and the validity-band derivation into one call - no separate flagsHint is needed. compositeRisk is max-grade: ANY fired blocker forces 'critical' regardless of flags; otherwise the worst flag priority wins (high > moderate > low), defaulting to low. Age-on-signing and 'today' both route through referenceDate(lpa) = lpa.signedDate || todayIso() - every persona here sets signedDate explicitly so grading never depends on the wall clock. computeValidityBand() checks lpa.status for 'registered'/'rejected'/'submitted' FIRST, before ever looking at signatures, so an explicit status short-circuits the signature-based derivation entirely.",
